    "history": [
      {
        "role": "user",
        "turn_id": "U01",
        "kind": "deliver",
        "content": "刚才整屋停电，现在灯已经亮了。我能马上把关掉的电器都重新打开吗？"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "kind": "heard_prefix",
        "observation_id": "synthetic-observation-001",
        "source": "synthetic_pcm_timeline",
        "heard_text": "不建议马上把所有电器一起打开，以免瞬间负",
        "playback_state": "speaking"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "turn_id": "U02",
        "kind": "deliver",
        "content": "先别讲原理，直接告诉我第一步做什么。"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "kind": "heard_prefix",
        "observation_id": "synthetic-observation-002-feedback-U02-59ffdf174591",
        "source": "synthetic_pcm_timeline",
        "heard_text": "第一步：先让所有大功率电器保持关闭，等五",
        "playback_state": "speaking"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "turn_id": "U02",
        "kind": "backchannel",
        "content": "嗯。"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "kind": "heard_prefix",
        "observation_id": "synthetic-observation-002",
        "source": "synthetic_pcm_timeline",
        "heard_text": "第一步：先让所有大功率电器保持关闭，等五分钟。",
        "playback_state": "finished"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "turn_id": "U03",
        "kind": "deliver",
        "content": "我看了一下，空调、电热水壶和台式电脑都关着，冰箱跟路由器还插着。"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "kind": "heard_prefix",
        "observation_id": "synthetic-observation-003",
        "source": "synthetic_pcm_timeline",
        "heard_text": "好，先保持现状。冰箱和路由器不用拔，等满五分钟后，再逐个开启电脑、热水壶和空调。",
        "playback_state": "finished"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "turn_id": "U04",
        "kind": "deliver",
        "content": "改一下，水壶今晚先不用，把它排除吧，只考虑空调和电脑。"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "kind": "heard_prefix",
        "observation_id": "synthetic-observation-004",
        "source": "synthetic_pcm_timeline",
        "heard_text": "接下来只考虑电脑和空调：等满五分钟后先开电脑，确认正常，再开空调。",
        "playback_state": "finished"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "turn_id": "U05",
        "kind": "deliver",
        "content": "那电脑和空调哪个先开比较稳妥？"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "kind": "heard_prefix",
        "observation_id": "synthetic-observation-005",
        "source": "synthetic_pcm_timeline",
        "heard_text": "先开电脑，确认运行正常后，再开空调。两者",
        "playback_state": "speaking"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "turn_id": "U06",
        "kind": "deliver",
        "content": "原理先跳过，两个之间大概要隔多久？"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "kind": "heard_prefix",
        "observation_id": "synthetic-observation-006-feedback-U06-2d0c5769a5bd",
        "source": "synthetic_pcm_timeline",
        "heard_text": "间隔两三分钟就行。先开电脑，运行正常后再",
        "playback_state": "speaking"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "kind": "heard_prefix",
        "observation_id": "synthetic-observation-006",
        "source": "synthetic_pcm_timeline",
        "heard_text": "间隔两三分钟就行。先开电脑，运行正常后再开空调；如果灯闪、跳闸或有异味，就先别开。",
        "playback_state": "finished"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "turn_id": "U07",
        "kind": "deliver",
        "content": "如果开其中一台以后又跳闸，我该怎么处理？"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "kind": "heard_prefix",
        "observation_id": "synthetic-observation-007-feedback-U07-c3d9ae4eb45d",
        "source": "synthetic_pcm_timeline",
        "heard_text": "先关掉并拔下刚开启的那台，空调和电脑都先别再开，也不要反复合闸。若有焦味、冒烟、",
        "playback_state": "speaking"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "turn_id": "U07",
        "kind": "backchannel",
        "content": "嗯嗯。"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "kind": "heard_prefix",
        "observation_id": "synthetic-observation-007",
        "source": "synthetic_pcm_timeline",
        "heard_text": "先关掉并拔下刚开启的那台，空调和电脑都先别再开，也不要反复合闸。若有焦味、冒烟、火花或配电箱异常发热，立即远离并联系物业或电工；有起火迹象就拨打消防电话。没有这些异常时，也先联系物业确认供电是否稳定，再请电工排查。",
        "playback_state": "finished"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "turn_id": "U08",
        "kind": "deliver",
        "content": "如果闻到焦糊味，我是不是就得直接停手？"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "kind": "heard_prefix",
        "observation_id": "synthetic-observation-008",
        "source": "synthetic_pcm_timeline",
        "heard_text": "对，立即停手。不要再开电器或反复合闸，也",
        "playback_state": "speaking"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "turn_id": "U09",
        "kind": "deliver",
        "content": "好，够了，最后帮我用一句话顺一下今晚该怎么开。"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "kind": "heard_prefix",
        "observation_id": "synthetic-observation-009",
        "source": "synthetic_pcm_timeline",
        "heard_text": "停电恢复满五分钟后先开电脑，正常运行两三分钟再开空调，水壶今晚不开；若跳闸或闻到焦糊味，立即停手。",
        "playback_state": "finished"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "turn_id": "U09",
        "kind": "end",
        "content": "好，明白了，谢谢，再见。"
      }
    ]
  },
